      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "KennenBringTheLight",
        "name": "Electrical Surge",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Kennen passively deals extra damage and adds a Mark of the Storm to his target every few attacks, and he can activate this ability to damage and add another Mark of the Storm to targets who are already marked.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Every 5th Attack deals an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(35/45/55/65/75 + ([[si:scaleap]]35% Ability Power) + ([[si:scalead]]80/90/100/110/120% bonus Attack Damage)) magic damage</span> <span>On-Hit</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Kennen sends out a blast of electricity, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(70/95/120/145/170 + ([[si:scaleap]]80% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to nearby enemies affected by <span>Mark of the Storm</span>.<br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The passive also applies <span>Mark of the Storm</span> and can critically strike for (35/45/55/65/75 + ([[si:scaleap]]35% Ability Power) + ([[si:scalead]]80/90/100/110/120% bonus Attack Damage)) × (1.4 + [[si:scalecritmult]]40% bonus Critical Strike Damage) instead.<br />Attacking structures will stack the passive, but not expend it. The active automatically hits enemies inside of <span>Slicing Maelstrom</span>.</span>",
