        "bodyHtml": "Kennen unleashes a magical storm, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(40/80/120 + ([[si:scaleap]]25% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to all nearby enemies every 0.5 seconds, and gaining <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">25/50/75 Armor</span> and <span>25/50/75 Magic Resist</span> for 3 seconds. Successive hits deal 10% increased damage for each hit the enemy has already suffered.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Enemies can only receive 3 stacks of <span>Mark of the Storm</span> from this ability.</span>",
